  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 10.96,
      "e": 13.63,
      "text": "(siren blaring)"
    },
    {
      "s": 67.88,
      "e": 70.86,
      "text": "- Right after the storm hit, our first responders"
    },
    {
      "s": 71.01,
      "e": 73.2,
      "text": "along with our law enforcement personnel"
    },
    {
      "s": 73.52,
      "e": 76.67,
      "text": "immediately went in to assess the area."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.9,
      "e": 79.82,
      "text": "We stood up our emergency operations center"
    },
    {
      "s": 79.82,
      "e": 83.3,
      "text": "within an hour or so after the storm hit the base."
    },
    {
      "s": 83.86,
      "e": 86.55,
      "text": "The impact area of the base was on the west end,"
    },
    {
      "s": 86.55,
      "e": 88.77,
      "text": "which is known as our industrial area,"
    },
    {
      "s": 88.77,
      "e": 90.15,
      "text": "or the warehouse district."
    },
    {
      "s": 90.33,
      "e": 93.08,
      "text": "We sustained substantial damage in that area."
    },
    {
      "s": 93.32,
      "e": 96.26,
      "text": "And some areas will have to be rebuilt after the storm."
    },
    {
      "s": 97.43,
      "e": 99.83,
      "text": "- [Narrator] This was an extremely severe storm."
    },
    {
      "s": 100.51,
      "e": 104.76,
      "text": "In its aftermath, 64 facilities on base were damaged,"
    },
    {
      "s": 105.22,
      "e": 108.77,
      "text": "with two of our major structures totally demolished."
    },
    {
      "s": 110.08,
      "e": 112.75,
      "text": "Electricity was lost across the installation."
    },
    {
      "s": 113.26,
      "e": 117.3,
      "text": "The perimeter gates at several areas were blown away."
    },
    {
      "s": 118.15,
      "e": 122.08,
      "text": "Huge vehicles and equipment were overturned everywhere."
    },
    {
      "s": 122.82,
      "e": 124.72,
      "text": "And almost 700 acres"
    },
    {
      "s": 124.72,
      "e": 129.71,
      "text": "of forest and pecan groves were completely destroyed."
    },
    {
      "s": 129.96,
      "e": 132.57,
      "text": "Work on electrical and telecommunications"
    },
    {
      "s": 132.65,
      "e": 136.7,
      "text": "distribution systems included 200 utility poles,"
    },
    {
      "s": 137.07,
      "e": 140.01,
      "text": "16 miles of single-mode fiber,"
    },
    {
      "s": 140.35,
      "e": 143.21,
      "text": "and 11 miles of copper communication conductors"
    },
    {
      "s": 143.62,
      "e": 147.41,
      "text": "with 27,000 splices and terminations."
    },
    {
      "s": 147.69,
      "e": 150.43,
      "text": "The initial recovery estimate given by base officials"
    },
    {
      "s": 150.54,
      "e": 154.5,
      "text": "exceeded 100 million dollars for utilities restoration,"
    },
    {
      "s": 155.0,
      "e": 157.49,
      "text": "facilities repair, and cleanup."
    },
    {
      "s": 161.42,
      "e": 164.12,
      "text": "The damaged stands of trees were clearcut."
    },
    {
      "s": 164.26,
      "e": 168.05,
      "text": "And personnel will be planting 140,000 trees"
    },
    {
      "s": 168.14,
      "e": 172.27,
      "text": "in 2018 to reforest the damaged areas."
    },
    {
      "s": 172.93,
      "e": 175.02,
      "text": "A total of 88 million dollars"
    },
    {
      "s": 175.02,
      "e": 177.03,
      "text": "of Marine Corps funding was spent"
    },
    {
      "s": 177.03,
      "e": 181.72,
      "text": "in 2017 for cleanup, repair, and minor construction."
    },
    {
      "s": 181.95,
      "e": 186.54,
      "text": "And another 7.5 million is budgeted in 2018"
    },
    {
      "s": 186.71,
      "e": 188.92,
      "text": "for repairs to the remaining facilities."
    }
  ],
